  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot.\n• Thinly slice apple into sticks.\n• Finely shred baby cos lettuce (see ingredients). Little cooks: Help wash and tear the salad leaves!"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate."
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine cos lettuce, apple, carrot and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste with salt and pepper.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• Little cooks: Take the lead by tossing the salad!"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top each tortilla with burger sauce, cos salad and cheeseburger plant-based crumbed chicken meatballs to serve. Enjoy! Little cooks: Take the lead and help build the tacos!"
    }
  ]
